# Redirects for Cloudflare Workers static assets. Vite copies public/ to the
# build root, so this lands at dist/_redirects. Cloudflare parses it and does not
# publish it, so it is never fetchable.
#
# This carries over the one redirect that lived in firebase.json's `hosting`
# block until the move to Cloudflare on 28/08/2026. Losing it was silent: with no
# rule, /suggestions falls through to the SPA fallback, which serves index.html
# with 200, and the router's catch-all renders the home page — so an old link
# looks like it worked while quietly landing somewhere else.
#
# The in-app suggestions board was retired in favour of the shared tracker; the
# route is deliberately absent from the router (see src/app/App.tsx), which is
# exactly why the redirect has to exist at the edge.
/suggestions https://issues.latam-tools.com.br/?projeto=recap 301
